Solana Agent Network (solana-agent-network)
This crate is a port/adaptation of Reason Network for the Solana Agent Network (devnet)
by themusebook. Reason branding, Reason sign-in/join links and Reason-hosted services were
removed; the bridge concepts (network card, x402m mailbox, peer discovery) were ported to Rust.
